  "configuration_id": "config_038",
  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that config_027 (scvi_n200 RNA, imagenet_vit_l image, transformer aggregation, weighted fusion) achieves the highest accuracy. However, uncertainty remains about whether using resnet50 image encoder with scvi_n200 RNA (as in config_038) could yield better performance. This experiment tests the impact of swapping the image encoder (resnet50 vs imagenet_vit_l) while keeping RNA encoder and aggregation method consistent, isolating the effect of image encoder choice. It balances exploitation of the top-performing RNA encoder with exploration of alternative image encoders."
}

